205743" paraeid="{22f02eff-b872-4789-b884-040d62b6fde8}{139}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; color: windowtext;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; line-height: 18px; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"> </span><span class="EOP SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; line-height: 18px;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div></div></div><ol style=""><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); line-height: 18px; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">If you need to report on a specific terminated employee, you can navigate to a period in which he/she was active. The pay period selected in the drop-down menu in the top </span><span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-position: left bottom; background-image: var(--urlContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2, url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,&quot;)); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">taskbar</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;"> controls the Employee Filter list in the Report Generator. Any employees who were active within the selected period will </span><span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-position: left bottom; background-image: var(--urlContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2, url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,&quot;)); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">show</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;"> in the Employee Filter list, allowing you to select the terminated employee and generate your report as needed.</span></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW7591869 BCX0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38);"><span class="SCXW7591869 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; white-space: pre !important;">&nbsp;</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); line-height: 18px; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"> </span><span class="EOP SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38);">&nbsp;</span></font></li><li><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" style="white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); line-height: 18px; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">If you need to report on a group of employees over </span><span class="NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-position: left bottom; background-image: var(--urlAdvancedProofingIssueV2, url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,&quot;)); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">a period of time</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">, including those who have since been </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">terminated</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">, you can do so by </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">utilizing</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;"> the Pay Group or Home Org Level Filters (depending on which is available in your chosen report), rather than the Employee Filter. Using one of these filters will </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">provide</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;"> a report that shows all employees who were assigned to the selected pay group(s) or home org level(s) during the date range you selected within the Report Generator, including those who have since been </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;">terminated</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7591869 BCX0" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="